Description: LOC-200 to HL7 v2.5 Laboratory Gateway
 Reads results from LOCMEDT LOC-200 (and Sysmex, Cobas, Horiba, UC-1000,
 Seamaty) laboratory analyzers via RS-232, TCP or HTTP, converts them to
 HL7 v2.5 ORU^R01 messages, and dispatches them via MLLP, file-drop or
 SFTP to practice information systems (Vitomed, curaMED, Aeskulap,
 Axenita, WinMed, DnaMed, Tomedo).
 .
 Plug-and-play device detection, hardened web UI, and enterprise-grade
 audit logging for nDSG / GDPR compliance.
